Indian queen serving food in draped silk saree and temple jewellery, to seated brahmins, oil painting in the style of Raja Ravi Varma, rich pigments, soft chiaroscuro, reverent, ancient Puranic-era lamp lit courtyard feast of low carved-stone and timber buildings, clay-tile roofs, warm evening light, wide horizontal composition with the subject left of centre and open space on the right, a purely visual image, every surface plain and unmarked.